#: .\core\services.py:92
msgid "Your payment page no longer accepts payments. Please contact support."
msgstr ""
"To'lov sahifangiz endi to'lov qabul qilmaydi. Qo'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga "
"murojaat qiling."

#: .\core\views.py:58
msgid "TapCon — accept payments with a single tap"
msgstr "TapCon — bir tegish bilan to'lov qabul qiling"

#: .\core\views.py:60
msgid ""
"An NFC card for your business. The customer taps it, enters the amount and "
"pays with Click, Payme, Uzum or a bank card — straight to your own merchant "
"account. No terminal, no monthly fee."
msgstr ""
"Biznesingiz uchun NFC karta. Mijoz kartaga tegadi, summani kiritadi va "
"Click, Payme, Uzum yoki bank kartasi orqali to'laydi — pul to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri sizning merchant hisobingizga tushadi. Terminal ham, oylik to'lov "
"ham kerak emas."

#: .\core\views.py:70
msgid "How it works — TapCon"
msgstr "Qanday ishlaydi — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:72
msgid ""
"Three steps: the customer taps your card, their phone opens your payment "
"page, they pay. The money goes to your merchant account and you see it "
"immediately. No app to install."
msgstr ""
"Uch qadam: mijoz kartangizga tegadi, telefonida to'lov sahifangiz ochiladi, "
"u to'laydi. Pul merchant hisobingizga tushadi va siz buni darhol ko'rasiz. "
"Hech qanday ilova o'rnatish shart emas."

#: .\core\views.py:82
msgid "For business — TapCon"
msgstr "Biznes uchun — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:84
msgid ""
"For cafes, shops, salons, taxis and couriers in Uzbekistan. Take cashless "
"payments without a POS terminal — one card on the counter and every payment "
"lands in your own account."
msgstr ""
"O'zbekistondagi kafelar, do'konlar, salonlar, taksilar va kuryerlar uchun. "
"POS terminalsiz naqdsiz to'lovlarni qabul qiling — peshtaxtada bitta karta, "
"va har bir to'lov o'z hisobingizga tushadi."

#: .\core\views.py:94
msgid "Pricing — TapCon"
msgstr "Narxlar — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:96
msgid ""
"100 000 soum for the card, paid once. No commission on payments, no monthly "
"fee, no contract. Your customers' money goes directly to your merchant "
"account — TapCon never holds it."
msgstr ""
"Karta uchun 100 000 so'm, bir marta to'lanadi. To'lovlardan komissiya yo'q, "
"oylik to'lov yo'q, shartnoma yo'q. Mijozlaringizning puli to'g'ridan-to'g'ri"
" merchant hisobingizga tushadi — TapCon uni ushlab turmaydi."

#: .\core\views.py:105
msgid "About us — TapCon"
msgstr "Biz haqimizda — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:107
msgid ""
"TapCon makes cashless payments simple for small businesses in Uzbekistan. "
"Who we are, why we built it, and how to reach us."
msgstr ""
"TapCon O'zbekistondagi kichik bizneslar uchun naqdsiz to'lovlarni sodda "
"qiladi. Biz kimmiz, buni nega yaratdik va biz bilan qanday bog'lanish "
"mumkin."

#: .\core\views.py:116
msgid "Questions and answers — TapCon"
msgstr "Savol-javob — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:118
msgid ""
"Which phones work, which payment methods are supported, when the money "
"arrives, what happens if a payment fails, and how to get a card for your "
"business."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi telefonlar ishlaydi, qanday to'lov usullari qo'llab-quvvatlanadi, pul "
"qachon keladi, to'lov amalga oshmasa nima bo'ladi va biznesingiz uchun "
"kartani qanday olish mumkin."

#: .\core\views.py:127
msgid "Privacy policy — TapCon"
msgstr "Maxfiylik siyosati — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:129
msgid ""
"What TapCon collects, why, how long it is kept, and who it is shared with. "
"TapCon never sees or stores your customers' card details."
msgstr ""
"TapCon nimalarni yig'adi, nega, qancha muddat saqlaydi va kim bilan "
"bo'lishadi. TapCon mijozlaringizning karta ma'lumotlarini hech qachon "
"ko'rmaydi va saqlamaydi."

#: .\core\views.py:138
msgid "Terms of service — TapCon"
msgstr "Foydalanish shartlari — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:140
msgid ""
"The terms for sellers using TapCon: what the service does, what it does not "
"do, how payments are settled, and why refunds are handled by your payment "
"provider rather than by TapCon."
msgstr ""
"TapCondan foydalanuvchi sotuvchilar uchun shartlar: xizmat nima qiladi, nima"
" qilmaydi, to'lovlar qanday hisob-kitob qilinadi va nega pul qaytarish "
"TapCon emas, to'lov provayderi orqali amalga oshiriladi."

#: .\core\views.py:151
msgid "Design system — TapCon"
msgstr "Dizayn tizimi — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:178
msgid "Order an NFC card — TapCon"
msgstr "NFC karta buyurtma qilish — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:180
msgid ""
"Order a TapCon card for your business. 100 000 soum, one payment, delivered "
"in Tashkent. Leave your number and we will call you back."
msgstr ""
"Biznesingiz uchun TapCon kartasini buyurtma qiling. 100 000 so'm, bir "
"martalik to'lov, Toshkent bo'ylab yetkazib beriladi. Raqamingizni qoldiring,"
" biz o'zimiz qo'ng'iroq qilamiz."

#: .\core\views.py:194
msgid "Order received — TapCon"
msgstr "Buyurtma qabul qilindi — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:205
msgid "Thank you. We will call you back shortly."
msgstr "Rahmat. Tez orada siz bilan bog'lanamiz."

#: .\core\views.py:210
msgid "Contact — TapCon"
msgstr "Aloqa — TapCon"

#: .\core\views.py:212
msgid ""
"Questions about TapCon, or want a card for your business? Call us, message "
"us on Telegram, or leave your number and we will call you back."
msgstr ""
"TapCon haqida savollaringiz bormi yoki biznesingiz uchun karta kerakmi? "
"Bizga qo'ng'iroq qiling, Telegramda yozing yoki raqamingizni qoldiring — biz"
" o'zimiz bog'lanamiz."

