#: .\templates\core\about.html:5
msgid "About TapCon"
msgstr "TapCon haqida"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:7
msgid ""
"TapCon makes accepting a payment in person as simple as handing over cash — "
"without a terminal."
msgstr "TapCon jonli to'lovni naqd pul uzatishdek oddiy qiladi — terminalsiz."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:10
msgid "Why we built it"
msgstr "Nega buni yaratdik"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:12
msgid ""
"In Uzbekistan almost everyone pays with Click, Payme or Uzum. But a small "
"business that wants to accept those payments has to read out a card number, "
"wait for a screenshot, or rent a terminal it cannot afford."
msgstr ""
"O'zbekistonda deyarli hamma Click, Payme yoki Uzum orqali to'laydi. Ammo "
"bunday to'lovlarni qabul qilmoqchi bo'lgan kichik biznes karta raqamini "
"aytib berishi, skrinshot kutishi yoki qimmat terminal ijaraga olishi kerak "
"bo'ladi."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:15
msgid ""
"A TapCon card removes that. It costs less than a month of terminal rent, "
"needs no power, and the money goes straight to the seller's own merchant "
"account."
msgstr ""
"TapCon kartasi bu muammoni yechadi. U terminalning bir oylik ijarasidan "
"arzon, quvvat talab qilmaydi, pul esa to'g'ridan-to'g'ri sotuvchining "
"merchant hisobiga tushadi."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:18
msgid "How we make money"
msgstr "Biz qanday daromad qilamiz"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:20
msgid ""
"We sell the card once. We take no commission from your payments and charge "
"no subscription. If you want us to obtain merchant accounts on your behalf, "
"that is a separate service you can decline."
msgstr ""
"Biz kartani bir marta sotamiz. To'lovlaringizdan komissiya olmaymiz va obuna"
" to'lovi yo'q. Agar merchant hisoblarini siz uchun ochishimizni istasangiz, "
"bu alohida xizmat — undan voz kechishingiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:23
msgid "Where we are"
msgstr "Qayerdamiz"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:24
msgid "Tashkent, Uzbekistan. Support is available in Uzbek and Russian."
msgstr "Toshkent, O'zbekiston. Qo'llab-quvvatlash o'zbek va rus tillarida."

#: .\templates\core\about.html:29
msgid "Get in touch"
msgstr "Bog'laning"

#: .\templates\core\about.html:30
msgid "We would rather answer a question than lose a customer to confusion."
msgstr ""
"Savolga javob berganimiz, mijozni tushunmovchilik tufayli yo'qotganimizdan "
"yaxshiroq."

#: .\templates\core\contact.html:8
msgid ""
"Call, write on Telegram, or leave your number and we will call you back."
msgstr ""
"Qo'ng'iroq qiling, Telegramga yozing yoki raqamingizni qoldiring — biz "
"o'zimiz bog'lanamiz."

#: .\templates\core\contact.html:29
msgid "We answer in Uzbek and Russian, and in English when we can."
msgstr ""
"O'zbek va rus tillarida, imkon bo'lsa ingliz tilida ham javob beramiz."

#: .\templates\core\contact.html:34
msgid "Write to us"
msgstr "Bizga yozing"

#: .\templates\core\contact.html:38
msgid "Send message"
msgstr "Xabar yuborish"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:5
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Ko'p beriladigan savollar"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:6
msgid "If your question is not here, call us or write on Telegram."
msgstr ""
"Savolingiz bu yerda bo'lmasa, qo'ng'iroq qiling yoki Telegramga yozing."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:11
msgid "Does the customer need to install anything?"
msgstr "Mijoz biror dastur o'rnatishi kerakmi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:12
msgid ""
"No. They tap the card and their browser opens your payment page. They only "
"need the payment app they already use."
msgstr ""
"Yo'q. Kartaga tegadi va brauzeri sizning to'lov sahifangizni ochadi. Unga "
"faqat o'zi ishlatadigan to'lov ilovasi kerak."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:16
msgid "Does the card need charging or internet?"
msgstr "Kartani quvvatlash yoki internet kerakmi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:17
msgid ""
"No. The card has no battery and no electronics beyond a chip that stores "
"your web address. It works forever as long as it is not physically "
"destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Yo'q. Kartada batareya yo'q, faqat veb-manzilingizni saqlaydigan chip bor. "
"Jismonan buzilmasa, u cheksiz ishlaydi."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:21
msgid "Where does the money go?"
msgstr "Pul qayerga tushadi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:22
msgid ""
"Straight to your own merchant account with the provider. TapCon never holds "
"your money and takes no commission from it."
msgstr ""
"To'g'ridan-to'g'ri provayderdagi o'z merchant hisobingizga. TapCon "
"pulingizni ushlab turmaydi va undan komissiya olmaydi."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:26
msgid "What if the customer's phone has no NFC?"
msgstr "Mijozning telefonida NFC bo'lmasa-chi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:27
msgid ""
"Your payment page is an ordinary web address, so you can also show it as a "
"QR code or send the link in a message."
msgstr ""
"To'lov sahifangiz oddiy veb-manzil, shuning uchun uni QR kod sifatida "
"ko'rsatishingiz yoki havolani xabarda yuborishingiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:31
msgid "Do I need a merchant account?"
msgstr "Menga merchant hisob kerakmi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:32
msgid ""
"Yes, with each provider you want to accept. If you already have them, "
"connect them in the portal for free. If not, we can obtain them for you as a"
" separate paid service."
msgstr ""
"Ha, qabul qilmoqchi bo'lgan har bir provayderda. Ular bo'lsa, portalda bepul"
" ulaysiz. Bo'lmasa, alohida pullik xizmat sifatida biz ochib beramiz."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:36
msgid "How much does it cost?"
msgstr "Narxi qancha?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:37
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(price)s soum per card, paid once. No subscription and no commission from "
"TapCon."
msgstr ""
"Bir karta %(price)s so'm, bir marta to'lanadi. Obuna ham, TapCon komissiyasi"
" ham yo'q."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:41
msgid "How long does it take to start?"
msgstr "Ishga tushirish qancha vaqt oladi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:42
msgid ""
"Registration takes a minute. We approve a business usually within a day. The"
" longest part is getting merchant accounts, if you do not already have them."
msgstr ""
"Ro'yxatdan o'tish bir daqiqa. Biznesni odatda bir kun ichida tasdiqlaymiz. "
"Eng uzun qismi — merchant hisoblarini olish, agar ular hali bo'lmasa."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:46
msgid "Can I have more than one card?"
msgstr "Bir nechta karta olsam bo'ladimi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:47
msgid ""
"Yes. Many cafes put one on each table. All of them open the same payment "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Ha. Ko'p kafelar har bir stolga bittadan qo'yadi. Hammasi bir xil to'lov "
"sahifasini ochadi."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:51
msgid "Is it safe to enter card details?"
msgstr "Karta ma'lumotlarini kiritish xavfsizmi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:52
msgid ""
"Card payments happen on the payment provider's own secure page, not ours. "
"TapCon never sees or stores card numbers."
msgstr ""
"Karta to'lovlari bizda emas, provayderning o'z xavfsiz sahifasida amalga "
"oshiriladi. TapCon karta raqamlarini ko'rmaydi va saqlamaydi."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:56
msgid "What if I lose a card?"
msgstr "Kartani yo'qotsam nima bo'ladi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:57
msgid ""
"Anyone finding it can only open your payment page and pay you money. Tell us"
" and we will issue a new address if you want the old one closed."
msgstr ""
"Uni topgan odam faqat to'lov sahifangizni ochib, sizga pul to'lay oladi. "
"Bizga ayting — eskisini yopib, yangi manzil beramiz."

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:63
msgid "Still have a question?"
msgstr "Yana savolingiz bormi?"

#: .\templates\core\faq.html:64
msgid "We answer in Uzbek and Russian, on the phone or on Telegram."
msgstr "Telefon yoki Telegram orqali o'zbek va rus tillarida javob beramiz."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:5 .\templates\layouts\marketing.html:37
#: .\templates\partials\navbar.html:18
msgid "For business"
msgstr "Biznes uchun"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:6
msgid ""
"TapCon suits any place where people pay in person and a terminal is too "
"much."
msgstr ""
"TapCon odamlar joyida to'laydigan va terminal ortiqcha bo'lgan har qanday "
"joyga mos keladi."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:11
msgid "Cafes and restaurants"
msgstr "Kafe va restoranlar"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:12
msgid ""
"A card on each table. The customer pays without waiting for anyone to bring "
"a terminal."
msgstr ""
"Har bir stolga bitta karta. Mijoz terminal olib kelishini kutmasdan "
"to'laydi."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:15
msgid "Shops and market stalls"
msgstr "Do'kon va bozor rastalari"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:16
msgid "One card by the till. Nothing to charge, nothing to break."
msgstr "Kassa yonida bitta karta. Quvvatlash ham, buziladigan narsa ham yo'q."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:19
msgid "Taxis and delivery"
msgstr "Taksi va yetkazib berish"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:20
msgid ""
"A card on the dashboard or in the courier's pocket. Payment confirmed before"
" they drive away."
msgstr ""
"Karta panelda yoki kuryer cho'ntagida. To'lov jo'nab ketishdan oldin "
"tasdiqlanadi."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:23
msgid "Barbers, salons, clinics"
msgstr "Sartaroshxona, salon, klinikalar"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:24
msgid "The client pays at the chair. No queue at the counter."
msgstr "Mijoz o'rindiqda o'tirib to'laydi. Kassada navbat yo'q."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:27
msgid "Services and repairs"
msgstr "Xizmat va ta'mirlash"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:28
msgid "Take payment at the customer's home, with a receipt in their own app."
msgstr "To'lovni mijoz uyida oling — cheki uning o'z ilovasida qoladi."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:31
msgid "Events and pop-ups"
msgstr "Tadbir va vaqtinchalik nuqtalar"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:32
msgid ""
"No power, no internet contract, no rented terminal for three days of "
"trading."
msgstr ""
"Uch kunlik savdo uchun quvvat ham, internet shartnomasi ham, ijaraga olingan"
" terminal ham kerak emas."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:38
msgid "What you need"
msgstr "Sizga nima kerak"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:40
msgid "A phone number to register with."
msgstr "Ro'yxatdan o'tish uchun telefon raqami."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:41
msgid "A merchant account with at least one provider."
msgstr "Kamida bitta provayderda merchant hisob."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:42
msgid "Somewhere to put the card."
msgstr "Kartani qo'yish uchun joy."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:46
msgid "What TapCon does not do"
msgstr "TapCon nima qilmaydi"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:48
msgid "We never hold your money — it goes to your own merchant account."
msgstr ""
"Pulingizni hech qachon ushlab turmaymiz — u o'z merchant hisobingizga "
"tushadi."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:49
msgid "We take no commission from your payments."
msgstr "To'lovlaringizdan komissiya olmaymiz."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:50
msgid "We never see or store your customers' card numbers."
msgstr "Mijozlaringizning karta raqamlarini ko'rmaymiz va saqlamaymiz."

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:57
msgid "Talk to us about your business"
msgstr "Biznesingiz haqida gaplashaylik"

#: .\templates\core\for_business.html:58
msgid ""
"Tell us what you sell and how you take payment today. We will tell you what "
"it takes."
msgstr ""
"Nima sotishingizni va hozir to'lovni qanday olishingizni ayting. Nima "
"kerakligini tushuntiramiz."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:6
msgid "Accept payments with a single tap"
msgstr "Bir tegish bilan to'lov qabul qiling"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:8
msgid ""
"Put a TapCon card on your counter. The customer taps it with their phone, "
"enters the amount and pays with Click, Payme, Uzum, Paynet or a bank card. "
"No terminal, no queue, no cables."
msgstr ""
"TapCon kartasini peshtaxtangizga qo'ying. Mijoz telefoni bilan tegadi, "
"summani kiritadi va Click, Payme, Uzum, Paynet yoki bank kartasi orqali "
"to'laydi. Terminal ham, navbat ham, sim ham yo'q."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:11 .\templates\core\home.html:105
#: .\templates\core\home.html:124 .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:57
#: .\templates\core\order.html:7 .\templates\core\pricing.html:24
#: .\templates\layouts\marketing.html:39 .\templates\partials\navbar.html:29
msgid "Order a card"
msgstr "Karta buyurtma qilish"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:12 .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:5
#: .\templates\core\order_done.html:16 .\templates\layouts\marketing.html:36
#: .\templates\partials\navbar.html:17
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Qanday ishlaydi"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:15
#, python-format
msgid "%(price)s soum per card — one payment, no monthly fee."
msgstr "Bir karta %(price)s so'm — bir marta to'lov, oylik to'lovsiz."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:23
msgid "Four steps, about ten seconds"
msgstr "To'rt qadam, taxminan o'n soniya"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:24
msgid ""
"Nothing to install. Any phone with NFC opens your payment page by itself."
msgstr ""
"Hech narsa o'rnatish shart emas. NFC'li har qanday telefon to'lov "
"sahifangizni o'zi ochadi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:29 .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:12
msgid "Tap"
msgstr "Tegizing"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:30
msgid "The customer holds their phone near your card."
msgstr "Mijoz telefonini kartangizga yaqinlashtiradi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:35
msgid "Your payment page opens. They type the amount."
msgstr "To'lov sahifangiz ochiladi. Mijoz summani kiritadi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:39 .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:22
msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Tanlang"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:40
msgid "They pick their app — Click, Payme, Uzum, Paynet or a card."
msgstr "O'z ilovasini tanlaydi — Click, Payme, Uzum, Paynet yoki karta."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:45
msgid "The money goes to your merchant account. You see it in your portal."
msgstr "Pul merchant hisobingizga tushadi. Buni portalda ko'rasiz."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:52
msgid "Every popular payment app"
msgstr "Barcha ommabop to'lov ilovalari"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:53
msgid "Your customers pay the way they already do."
msgstr "Mijozlaringiz odatdagidek to'laydi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:60
msgid "Why businesses use TapCon"
msgstr "Nega bizneslar TapCon'ni tanlaydi"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:64
msgid "The money is yours"
msgstr "Pul sizniki"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:65
msgid ""
"Payments go straight to your own merchant accounts. TapCon never holds your "
"money."
msgstr ""
"To'lovlar to'g'ridan-to'g'ri o'z merchant hisoblaringizga tushadi. TapCon "
"pulingizni ushlab turmaydi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:68
msgid "Nothing to buy but the card"
msgstr "Kartadan boshqa hech narsa sotib olish shart emas"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:69
msgid "No terminal, no rent, no monthly fee. One card, one payment."
msgstr ""
"Terminal ham, ijara ham, oylik to'lov ham yo'q. Bitta karta, bitta to'lov."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:72
msgid "Works on any counter"
msgstr "Har qanday peshtaxtada ishlaydi"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:73
msgid ""
"A cafe table, a taxi dashboard, a market stall. The card needs no power."
msgstr "Kafe stoli, taksi paneli, bozor rastasi. Karta quvvat talab qilmaydi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:76
msgid "Every payment recorded"
msgstr "Har bir to'lov qayd etiladi"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:77
msgid "See what came in today, by app, confirmed by the provider itself."
msgstr ""
"Bugun qancha tushganini ilovalar bo'yicha ko'ring — provayderning o'zi "
"tasdiqlaydi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:80
msgid "Your customers need nothing new"
msgstr "Mijozlaringizga yangi hech narsa kerak emas"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:81
msgid ""
"No app to install, no registration. Their phone opens the page by itself."
msgstr ""
"Ilova o'rnatish ham, ro'yxatdan o'tish ham shart emas. Telefoni sahifani "
"o'zi ochadi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:84
msgid "In three languages"
msgstr "Uch tilda"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:85
msgid "Uzbek, Russian and English — the page follows the customer's phone."
msgstr "O'zbek, rus va ingliz tillarida — sahifa mijoz telefoniga moslashadi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:93 .\templates\core\pricing.html:11
msgid "TapCon card"
msgstr "TapCon kartasi"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:95 .\templates\core\pricing.html:13
#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:52 .\templates\merchants\dashboard.html:18
#: .\templates\merchants\dashboard.html:26
#: .\templates\merchants\dashboard.html:34
#: .\templates\merchants\transactions.html:82 .\templates\payments\pay.html:56
#: .\templates\payments\result.html:33 .\templates\payments\result.html:55
#: .\templates\payments\result.html:76
msgid "soum"
msgstr "so'm"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:97 .\templates\core\pricing.html:15
msgid "per card, one payment"
msgstr "bir karta uchun, bir marta"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:99 .\templates\core\pricing.html:17
msgid "The NFC card itself"
msgstr "NFC kartaning o'zi"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:100 .\templates\core\pricing.html:18
msgid "Your own payment page"
msgstr "Shaxsiy to'lov sahifangiz"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:101 .\templates\core\pricing.html:19
msgid "Merchant portal with transactions"
msgstr "Tranzaksiyalar bilan sotuvchi portali"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:102
msgid "No monthly fee, no commission from TapCon"
msgstr "Oylik to'lov yo'q, TapCon komissiyasi yo'q"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:108
msgid "Connecting your merchant accounts"
msgstr "Merchant hisoblaringizni ulash"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:110
msgid ""
"To accept payments you need a merchant account with each provider — Click, "
"Payme, Uzum, Paynet. If you already have them, connect them yourself in the "
"portal for free."
msgstr ""
"To'lov qabul qilish uchun har bir provayderda merchant hisob kerak — Click, "
"Payme, Uzum, Paynet. Ular bo'lsa, portalda o'zingiz bepul ulaysiz."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:113
msgid ""
"If you do not, we can obtain them for you. This is a separate service and is"
" priced per business, because each provider asks for different documents."
msgstr ""
"Bo'lmasa, biz ochib beramiz. Bu alohida xizmat va narxi har bir biznes uchun"
" alohida belgilanadi, chunki har bir provayder turli hujjat so'raydi."

#: .\templates\core\home.html:115 .\templates\core\pricing.html:38
msgid "Ask about setup"
msgstr "Ulash haqida so'rang"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:122
msgid "Start accepting payments this week"
msgstr "Shu hafta to'lov qabul qilishni boshlang"

#: .\templates\core\home.html:123
msgid "Order a card, connect your providers, and put it on the counter."
msgstr "Karta buyurtma qiling, provayderlarni ulang va peshtaxtaga qo'ying."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:6
msgid ""
"For the customer it is one tap. For you it is a card on the counter and a "
"page in your portal."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz uchun bu bitta tegish. Siz uchun — peshtaxtadagi karta va portaldagi "
"sahifa."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:13
msgid "The customer holds their phone near your card. No app, no scanning."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz telefonini kartangizga yaqinlashtiradi. Ilova ham, skanerlash ham "
"kerak emas."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:18
msgid "Your payment page opens in their browser. They type what they owe."
msgstr ""
"To'lov sahifangiz uning brauzerida ochiladi. To'lanadigan summani kiritadi."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:23
msgid "They tap the app they use. It opens with the amount already filled in."
msgstr ""
"O'zi ishlatadigan ilovani bosadi. Ilova summa kiritilgan holda ochiladi."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:28
msgid ""
"The provider confirms the payment to us and the money reaches your account."
msgstr ""
"Provayder to'lovni bizga tasdiqlaydi va pul hisobingizga yetib boradi."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:34
msgid "What you do once"
msgstr "Bir marta qiladigan ishlar"

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:36
msgid "Order a card and register with your phone number."
msgstr "Karta buyurtma qiling va telefon raqamingiz bilan ro'yxatdan o'ting."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:37
msgid "Enter your merchant credentials for the providers you use."
msgstr ""
"Ishlatadigan provayderlaringiz uchun merchant ma'lumotlarini kiriting."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:38
msgid "We approve your business, usually within a day."
msgstr "Biznesingizni tasdiqlaymiz — odatda bir kun ichida."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:39
msgid "Put the card where customers pay."
msgstr "Kartani mijozlar to'laydigan joyga qo'ying."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:43
msgid "What about phones without NFC?"
msgstr "NFC'siz telefonlar-chi?"

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:45
msgid ""
"Most phones sold in the last few years read NFC. Older iPhones and some "
"cheap Android phones do not."
msgstr ""
"So'nggi yillarda sotilgan telefonlarning aksariyati NFC'ni o'qiydi. Eski "
"iPhone'lar va ba'zi arzon Android telefonlar o'qimaydi."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:48
msgid ""
"Your payment page is an ordinary web address, so it also works from a QR "
"code or a link you send in a message."
msgstr ""
"To'lov sahifangiz oddiy veb-manzil, shuning uchun QR kod yoki xabardagi "
"havola orqali ham ishlaydi."

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:55
msgid "Ready to try it?"
msgstr "Sinab ko'rasizmi?"

#: .\templates\core\how_it_works.html:56
msgid "Order a card and we will call you back to arrange delivery."
msgstr ""
"Karta buyurtma qiling — yetkazib berishni kelishish uchun biz bog'lanamiz."

#: .\templates\core\notifications.html:4 .\templates\core\notifications.html:5
#: .\templates\partials\notification_bell.html:9
#: .\templates\partials\notification_bell.html:22
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Bildirishnomalar"

#: .\templates\core\notifications.html:12
#, python-format
msgid "%(counter)s unread"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s unread"
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s ta o'qilmagan"

#: .\templates\core\notifications.html:17
#: .\templates\partials\notification_bell.html:27
msgid "Mark all read"
msgstr "Hammasini o'qildi"

#: .\templates\core\notifications.html:26
#: .\templates\partials\notification_bell.html:36
msgid "Nothing new yet."
msgstr "Hozircha yangilik yo'q."

#: .\templates\core\order.html:8
msgid ""
"Leave your number and we will call you back to confirm the order and arrange"
" delivery."
msgstr ""
"Raqamingizni qoldiring — buyurtmani tasdiqlash va yetkazib berishni "
"kelishish uchun bog'lanamiz."

#: .\templates\core\order.html:12
msgid "What happens next"
msgstr "Keyin nima bo'ladi"

#: .\templates\core\order.html:14
msgid "We call you to confirm quantity and address."
msgstr "Miqdor va manzilni tasdiqlash uchun qo'ng'iroq qilamiz."

#: .\templates\core\order.html:15
msgid "We deliver the cards and help you register."
msgstr "Kartalarni yetkazamiz va ro'yxatdan o'tishga yordam beramiz."

#: .\templates\core\order.html:16
msgid "You connect your payment providers and start taking payments."
msgstr ""
"To'lov provayderlaringizni ulaysiz va to'lov qabul qilishni boshlaysiz."

#: .\templates\core\order.html:19
#, python-format
msgid "%(price)s soum per card. Payment on delivery."
msgstr "Bir karta %(price)s so'm. To'lov yetkazib berilganda."

#: .\templates\core\order.html:28
msgid "Send order"
msgstr "Buyurtma yuborish"

#: .\templates\core\order.html:30
msgid "We only use your number to contact you about this order."
msgstr ""
"Raqamingizdan faqat shu buyurtma bo'yicha bog'lanish uchun foydalanamiz."

#: .\templates\core\order_done.html:12
msgid "Order received"
msgstr "Buyurtma qabul qilindi"

#: .\templates\core\order_done.html:13
msgid "Thank you. We will call you back shortly to confirm the details."
msgstr "Rahmat. Tafsilotlarni tasdiqlash uchun tez orada bog'lanamiz."

#: .\templates\core\order_done.html:15
msgid "Back to home"
msgstr "Bosh sahifaga"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:5 .\templates\layouts\marketing.html:38
#: .\templates\partials\navbar.html:19
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Narxlar"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:6
msgid ""
"One payment for the card. No subscription, and TapCon takes no commission "
"from your sales."
msgstr ""
"Karta uchun bir marta to'lov. Obuna yo'q, TapCon savdongizdan komissiya "
"olmaydi."

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:20
msgid "Connect your own provider accounts yourself, free"
msgstr "O'z provayder hisoblaringizni o'zingiz bepul ulaysiz"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:21
msgid "Support in Uzbek and Russian"
msgstr "O'zbek va rus tillarida qo'llab-quvvatlash"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:28
msgid "Merchant account setup"
msgstr "Merchant hisobini ochish"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:29
msgid "Priced per business"
msgstr "Narx har bir biznes uchun alohida"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:30
msgid "Optional — only if you want us to do it"
msgstr "Ixtiyoriy — faqat biz qilishimizni istasangiz"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:32
msgid ""
"To accept payments you need a merchant account with each provider you want "
"to offer: Click, Payme, Uzum, Paynet. Each of them asks for different "
"documents and takes a different amount of time."
msgstr ""
"To'lov qabul qilish uchun taklif qilmoqchi bo'lgan har bir provayderda "
"merchant hisob kerak: Click, Payme, Uzum, Paynet. Har biri turli hujjat "
"so'raydi va turli vaqt oladi."

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:35
msgid ""
"If you already have those accounts, enter the credentials in your portal and"
" pay us nothing extra. If you would rather we handled the paperwork, tell us"
" which providers you need and we will quote you."
msgstr ""
"Bu hisoblar bo'lsa, ma'lumotlarni portalga kiriting — qo'shimcha to'lov "
"yo'q. Hujjatlarni biz bajarishimizni istasangiz, qaysi provayderlar "
"kerakligini ayting, narxini aytamiz."

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:44
msgid "What else might cost money"
msgstr "Yana nima pul turishi mumkin"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:48
msgid ""
"Your payment providers charge their own commission on each payment. That is "
"between you and them — TapCon adds nothing on top."
msgstr ""
"To'lov provayderlaringiz har bir to'lovdan o'z komissiyasini oladi. Bu siz "
"bilan ular o'rtasida — TapCon ustiga hech narsa qo'shmaydi."

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:49
msgid "Delivery of the cards, if you are outside Tashkent."
msgstr "Toshkentdan tashqarida bo'lsangiz, kartalarni yetkazib berish."

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:50
msgid "Extra cards, at the same price per card."
msgstr "Qo'shimcha kartalar — har biri shu narxda."

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:57
msgid "Questions about price?"
msgstr "Narx bo'yicha savollar bormi?"

#: .\templates\core\pricing.html:58
msgid "Call us or write on Telegram. We answer in Uzbek and Russian."
msgstr ""
"Qo'ng'iroq qiling yoki Telegramga yozing. O'zbek va rus tillarida javob "
"beramiz."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:5 .\templates\layouts\marketing.html:49
msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Maxfiylik siyosati"

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:6 .\templates\core\terms.html:6
msgid "Draft. To be reviewed by a lawyer before launch."
msgstr "Qoralama. Ishga tushirishdan oldin yurist ko'rib chiqadi."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:8
msgid "What we collect"
msgstr "Nimalarni yig'amiz"

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:10
msgid ""
"From sellers: phone number, name, business name, address, and the provider "
"credentials you enter."
msgstr ""
"Sotuvchilardan: telefon raqami, ism, biznes nomi, manzil va siz kiritgan "
"provayder ma'lumotlari."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:11
msgid "From people ordering cards: name, phone number, delivery address."
msgstr ""
"Karta buyurtma qiluvchilardan: ism, telefon raqami, yetkazib berish manzili."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:12
msgid ""
"From customers paying: the amount and which provider they chose. Nothing "
"that identifies them personally."
msgstr ""
"To'lovchi mijozlardan: summa va tanlangan provayder. Shaxsni aniqlaydigan "
"hech narsa emas."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:15
msgid "What we never collect"
msgstr "Nimalarni hech qachon yig'maymiz"

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:17
msgid ""
"Card numbers, CVV codes or any card details. Card payments happen on the "
"provider's own page."
msgstr ""
"Karta raqamlari, CVV kodlar yoki karta ma'lumotlari. Karta to'lovlari "
"provayderning o'z sahifasida bo'ladi."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:18
msgid "Passport or ID numbers."
msgstr "Pasport yoki ID raqamlari."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:21
msgid "How we protect provider credentials"
msgstr "Provayder ma'lumotlarini qanday himoya qilamiz"

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:22
msgid ""
"Your merchant credentials are encrypted in our database, never shown back to"
" you in full, and never written to logs."
msgstr ""
"Merchant ma'lumotlaringiz bazamizda shifrlangan, to'liq holda qaytarib "
"ko'rsatilmaydi va loglarga yozilmaydi."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:24
msgid "Who we share it with"
msgstr "Kim bilan bo'lishamiz"

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:25
msgid ""
"Payment providers receive what they need to process a payment. Our SMS "
"provider receives your phone number to deliver a confirmation code. We sell "
"your data to nobody."
msgstr ""
"To'lov provayderlari to'lovni amalga oshirish uchun zarur ma'lumotni oladi. "
"SMS provayderimiz tasdiqlash kodini yetkazish uchun raqamingizni oladi. "
"Ma'lumotlaringizni hech kimga sotmaymiz."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:27
msgid "How long we keep it"
msgstr "Qancha vaqt saqlaymiz"

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:28
msgid ""
"Transaction records are kept while your account is active and afterwards as "
"long as the law requires. Confirmation codes are deleted within minutes."
msgstr ""
"Tranzaksiya yozuvlari hisobingiz faol bo'lgunicha va keyin qonun talab "
"qilgan muddatgacha saqlanadi. Tasdiqlash kodlari bir necha daqiqada "
"o'chiriladi."

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:30
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr "Huquqlaringiz"

#: .\templates\core\privacy.html:31
msgid ""
"Ask us to correct or delete your data at any time using the contacts below. "
"We will do it unless the law requires us to keep a record."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi kontaktlar orqali istalgan vaqtda ma'lumotlaringizni tuzatish yoki "
"o'chirishni so'rang. Qonun saqlashni talab qilmasa, bajaramiz."

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:4
msgid "Design system"
msgstr "Dizayn tizimi"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:5
msgid ""
"Every page is built from these pieces. Change a token, everything follows."
msgstr ""
"Har bir sahifa shu qismlardan yig'iladi. Bitta qiymatni o'zgartirsangiz, "
"hammasi ergashadi."

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:8
msgid "Colours"
msgstr "Ranglar"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:19
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "Tugmalar"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:21
msgid "Pay"
msgstr "To'lash"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:22
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Bekor qilish"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:23 .\templates\core\styleguide.html:61
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "O'chirilgan"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:28
msgid "Provider buttons"
msgstr "To'lov tizimi tugmalari"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:43
msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "Kiritish maydonlari"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:58
msgid "Badges & toggle"
msgstr "Nishonlar va tugma"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:60
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Faol"

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:66
msgid "Saved successfully."
msgstr "Muvaffaqiyatli saqlandi."

#: .\templates\core\styleguide.html:67
msgid "Something went wrong."
msgstr "Xatolik yuz berdi."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:5 .\templates\layouts\marketing.html:50
msgid "Terms of service"
msgstr "Foydalanish shartlari"

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:8
msgid "What TapCon provides"
msgstr "TapCon nima taqdim etadi"

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:9
msgid ""
"TapCon supplies an NFC card and a payment page that forwards your customer "
"to the payment provider you have chosen. TapCon is not a bank, not a payment"
" institution, and does not hold your money."
msgstr ""
"TapCon NFC karta va mijozingizni siz tanlagan to'lov provayderiga "
"yo'naltiruvchi to'lov sahifasini taqdim etadi. TapCon bank ham, to'lov "
"tashkiloti ham emas va pulingizni ushlab turmaydi."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:11
msgid "Your responsibilities"
msgstr "Sizning majburiyatlaringiz"

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:13
msgid "Keep your own merchant accounts with the providers in good standing."
msgstr "Provayderlardagi merchant hisoblaringizni faol holatda saqlang."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:14
msgid "Keep your account credentials and provider keys secret."
msgstr "Hisob ma'lumotlaringiz va provayder kalitlarini maxfiy saqlang."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:15
msgid "Only accept payments for lawful goods and services."
msgstr "Faqat qonuniy tovar va xizmatlar uchun to'lov qabul qiling."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:16
msgid "Give your customers a receipt where the law requires one."
msgstr "Qonun talab qilgan hollarda mijozlarga chek bering."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:19
msgid "Approval and suspension"
msgstr "Tasdiqlash va to'xtatish"

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:20
msgid ""
"A new business must be approved before its payment page accepts payments. We"
" may suspend an account that breaks these terms or that a provider asks us "
"to stop serving."
msgstr ""
"Yangi biznesning to'lov sahifasi to'lov qabul qilishidan oldin tasdiqlanishi"
" shart. Ushbu shartlarni buzgan yoki provayder xizmatni to'xtatishni "
"so'ragan hisobni to'xtatishimiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:22
msgid "Money and commission"
msgstr "Pul va komissiya"

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:23
msgid ""
"Payments go directly to your merchant account. TapCon takes no commission. "
"Your providers charge their own fees under your agreement with them."
msgstr ""
"To'lovlar to'g'ridan-to'g'ri merchant hisobingizga tushadi. TapCon komissiya"
" olmaydi. Provayderlaringiz siz bilan tuzgan shartnoma bo'yicha o'z "
"to'lovlarini oladi."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:25
msgid "The card: price and replacement"
msgstr "Karta: narxi va almashtirish"

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:26
msgid ""
"The card is paid for once, on delivery. A faulty card is replaced free of "
"charge."
msgstr ""
"Karta bir marta, yetkazib berishda to'lanadi. Nosoz karta bepul "
"almashtiriladi."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:34
msgid "Returning a payment to a customer"
msgstr "Mijozga to'lovni qaytarish"

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:35
msgid ""
"TapCon does not return payments. Money goes straight from your customer to "
"your own merchant account, and we never hold it, so we have nothing to send "
"back."
msgstr ""
"TapCon to'lovlarni qaytarmaydi. Pul mijozdan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri sizning "
"merchant hisobingizga tushadi, biz uni hech qachon ushlab turmaymiz, shuning"
" uchun qaytaradigan narsamiz yo'q."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:36
msgid ""
"If a customer paid too much or should be refunded, settle it with them "
"directly, or ask your payment provider to return the payment through their "
"own system. A payment your provider returns is shown in your transactions as"
" “Returned to customer” and is not counted in your takings."
msgstr ""
"Agar mijoz ortiqcha to'lagan bo'lsa yoki pulini qaytarish kerak bo'lsa, u "
"bilan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri hisob-kitob qiling yoki to'lov tizimingizdan "
"to'lovni o'z tizimi orqali qaytarishni so'rang. To'lov tizimi qaytargan "
"to'lov tranzaksiyalaringizda «Mijozga qaytarilgan» deb ko'rsatiladi va "
"tushumingizga qo'shilmaydi."

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:38
msgid "Limits of responsibility"
msgstr "Javobgarlik chegaralari"

#: .\templates\core\terms.html:39
msgid ""
"We do our best to keep the service running, but we are not responsible for a"
" payment provider being unavailable, nor for a dispute between you and your "
"customer."
msgstr ""
"Xizmatni uzluksiz ishlatishga harakat qilamiz, ammo to'lov provayderining "
"ishlamay qolishi yoki siz bilan mijoz o'rtasidagi nizo uchun javobgar "
"emasmiz."

